Fumble is a spirit magic spell that disrupts the victim's coordination,
causing them to drop whatever they are holding. The spell creates a
momentary disconnect between mind and body, making the target's grip
fail at a critical moment.

Usage: cast 'fumble' <target>

This spell forces the victim to drop held items, potentially disarming
dangerous opponents or causing them to lose important equipment. The
spell becomes less effective against creatures of significantly higher
level than the caster, as their greater mental fortitude resists the
magical disruption.

Fumble is a tasked spell requiring concentration to complete. It is
particularly useful against weapon-wielding enemies, though it can
affect any held item.

Class: Mage
Discipline: Spirit

